    "result_text": "The full test suite passes: **68 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors, BUILD SUCCESS**.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `ownerSegment` derived field on the Owner API, following the existing conventions for derived owner fields (`membershipLevel`, `locality`, etc.).\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added the read-only `ownerSegment` property to the OwnerDto schema (so the generated DTO gets the field/setter), documented as `'<TIER>_<AREA>'`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added:\n   - A `@Mapping` wiring `ownerSegment` to a new `ownerSegment(owner)` expression.\n   - The `ownerSegment(Owner)` method, which reuses the existing `membershipLevel(owner)` and `locality(owner)` derivations:\n     - **TIER** = `PREMIUM` when `membershipLevel >= 3`, else `STANDARD`.\n     - **AREA** = `METRO` when locality is a known region (`NSW`, `VIC`, `QLD`), else `REGIONAL`.\n\nThe new `Cp55Tests` (verifying `STANDARD_METRO` for a known city and `STANDARD_REGIONAL` for an unknown one) pass, and all 68 tests remain green.",
